10:[["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border bg-[#eef3f8] py-16 text-slate-900 sm:py-24","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-0 opacity-70 [background-image:radial-gradient(circle_at_88%_12%,rgba(14,116,144,0.12),transparent_32%),radial-gradient(circle_at_10%_80%,rgba(37,99,235,0.10),transparent_36%)]"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container-site relative","children":[["$","$L1a",null,{"href":"/highlights/blogs","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-700 hover:text-teal-800","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left size-4"}],"All articles"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 max-w-4xl","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors border-transparent bg-secondary/10 text-secondary dark:text-blue-300","children":"Careers"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-5 font-heading text-4xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl","children":"The Career Opportunities for CS Graduates after Covid-19"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-600","children":"Are you a computer science graduate feeling clueless about your career amidst the ongoing pandemic situation? Well, that’s quite normal. Millions of others like you are in a similar state of mind."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-500","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"CITIS InfoTech Editorial"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M8 2v3","key":"1ioesn"}],["path",{"d":"M16 2v3","key":"otl347"}],["rect",{"x":"3","y":"3","width":"18","height":"18","rx":"2","key":"h1oib"}],["path",{"d":"M3 9h18","key":"1pudct"}],["path",{"d":"M8 13h.01","key":"1sbv64"}],["path",{"d":"M12 13h.01","key":"y0uutt"}],["path",{"d":"M16 13h.01","key":"wip0gl"}],["path",{"d":"M8 17h.01","key":"p3bg7i"}],["path",{"d":"M12 17h.01","key":"p32p05"}],["path",{"d":"M16 17h.01","key":"ql8jdd"}]],"className":"lucide-calendar-days size-4"}],"19 August 2021"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10","key":"1mglay"}],["path",{"d":"M12 6v6l4 2","key":"mmk7yg"}]],"className":"lucide-clock size-4"}],"6 min read"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-[#e8edf5] dark:bg-slate-900","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-site grid gap-10 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_13rem] lg:gap-16 lg:py-20","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl","children":[[["$","section","Overview",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Overview"}],[["$","p","Are you a computer science graduate feeling clueless about your career amidst the ongoing pandemic situation? Well, that’s quite normal. Millions of others like you are in a similar state of mind.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Are you a computer science graduate feeling clueless about your career amidst the ongoing pandemic situation? Well, that’s quite normal. Millions of others like you are in a similar state of mind."}],["$","p","As a fresh computer science graduate, you may have lost the recruitment season, and wondering whether you will only end up wasting time at home, doing nothing this year.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"As a fresh computer science graduate, you may have lost the recruitment season, and wondering whether you will only end up wasting time at home, doing nothing this year."}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"]]}],"$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28"],"$L29"]}],"$L2a"]}]}]]}],"$L2b","$L2c"]
1c:["$","p","Again, elsewhere the feeling isn’t any different either. A lot of them are confronting despair, and afraid whether they’ve got any hopes this year, or not.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Again, elsewhere the feeling isn’t any different either. A lot of them are confronting despair, and afraid whether they’ve got any hopes this year, or not."}]
1d:["$","p","The current situation may not be as conducive. Stats may have proven wrong. But that doesn’t mean you let your hopes implode, and do nothing to uplift yourself.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"The current situation may not be as conducive. Stats may have proven wrong. But that doesn’t mean you let your hopes implode, and do nothing to uplift yourself."}]
1e:["$","p","With business engines reigniting, and economies restarting, you’ll see a lot of new opportunities coming your way, and for which, you’ve got to prepare yourself.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"With business engines reigniting, and economies restarting, you’ll see a lot of new opportunities coming your way, and for which, you’ve got to prepare yourself."}]
1f:["$","p","So, what do you do after computer science to give your career a kick start after the pandemic? Read this blog to explore the answer. It discusses some post-COVID-19 career options and opportunities.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"So, what do you do after computer science to give your career a kick start after the pandemic? Read this blog to explore the answer. It discusses some post-COVID-19 career options and opportunities."}]
20:["$","section","Capabilities to Develop for a More Hopeful Career after Covid-19",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Capabilities to Develop for a More Hopeful Career after Covid-19"}],[["$","p","Experts say that the world will change after the pandemic. If that’s true, the business world will require even smarter and more capable people on board. It will need a workforce that will help businesses revive and get everything back on track in the quickest way possible.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Experts say that the world will change after the pandemic. If that’s true, the business world will require even smarter and more capable people on board. It will need a workforce that will help businesses revive and get everything back on track in the quickest way possible."}],["$","p","In that case, the conventional thought process, approach, and concepts are unlikely to work. The world will need something innovative and quick. So you’ve got to learn something that will help you thrive.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"In that case, the conventional thought process, approach, and concepts are unlikely to work. The world will need something innovative and quick. So you’ve got to learn something that will help you thrive."}],["$","p","Remember, it is all about futuristic and sustainable thinking, and further aligning your actions to it. So, let us now proceed to take a look at what all you may do to add a new, and perhaps, a more aligned dimension to your career and futuristic capabilities.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Remember, it is all about futuristic and sustainable thinking, and further aligning your actions to it. So, let us now proceed to take a look at what all you may do to add a new, and perhaps, a more aligned dimension to your career and futuristic capabilities."}]]]}]
21:["$","section","Artificial Intelligence",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Artificial Intelligence"}],[["$","p","Yes, that tops the list! AI replicates human intelligence, and helps businesses make better use of data for better, informed, and more comprehensive decision making. And, guess what, AI proves useful across various verticals, right from sales and marketing to operations, human resources, and strategic planning.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Yes, that tops the list! AI replicates human intelligence, and helps businesses make better use of data for better, informed, and more comprehensive decision making. And, guess what, AI proves useful across various verticals, right from sales and marketing to operations, human resources, and strategic planning."}],["$","p","So, the need for AI experts and professionals is likely to grow multiple-fold in the time to come. If you stay ready with an AI certification by your side, you will distinguish yourself from the conventional computer science graduates that will crowd the gate of your prospective employer",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"So, the need for AI experts and professionals is likely to grow multiple-fold in the time to come. If you stay ready with an AI certification by your side, you will distinguish yourself from the conventional computer science graduates that will crowd the gate of your prospective employer"}]]]}]
22:["$","section","Data Science and Analytics",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Data Science and Analytics"}],[["$","p","These days, and in fact, in the days to come, data will continue to remain gold for businesses. After Covid-19, data will become even more critical for companies to survive.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"These days, and in fact, in the days to come, data will continue to remain gold for businesses. After Covid-19, data will become even more critical for companies to survive."}],["$","p","As a data scientist and analyst, you will control and leverage the most valuable asset of the company – data. Hence, a career in data science and analytics will prove a sustainable career choice.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"As a data scientist and analyst, you will control and leverage the most valuable asset of the company – data. Hence, a career in data science and analytics will prove a sustainable career choice."}],["$","p","Besides, India will produce over 200,000 data science jobs in 2020, which are healthy signs that you must choose a career as a data scientist and analyst.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Besides, India will produce over 200,000 data science jobs in 2020, which are healthy signs that you must choose a career as a data scientist and analyst."}],["$","p","You can enroll for data science and analytics courses while dealing with this situation, and make prudent use of your time for a better and brighter career.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"You can enroll for data science and analytics courses while dealing with this situation, and make prudent use of your time for a better and brighter career."}]]]}]
23:["$","section","Ethical Hacking",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Ethical Hacking"}],[["$","p","Ethical hacking is another lucrative career alternative that you may want to consider post the Covid-19 crisis. As an ethical hacker, you safeguard your company’s software, applications, networks, and servers from external threats, and hackers, and cybercriminals.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Ethical hacking is another lucrative career alternative that you may want to consider post the Covid-19 crisis. As an ethical hacker, you safeguard your company’s software, applications, networks, and servers from external threats, and hackers, and cybercriminals."}],["$","p","In other words, you play a crucial role in ensuring the company’s virtual security. You’ve got several ethical hacking courses out there, online as well as the classroom ones. You may choose the one that suits your pocket and the situation out there.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"In other words, you play a crucial role in ensuring the company’s virtual security. You’ve got several ethical hacking courses out there, online as well as the classroom ones. You may choose the one that suits your pocket and the situation out there."}]]]}]
24:["$","section","Graphic Designing",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Graphic Designing"}],[["$","p","With graphic designing capabilities, people may term you a computer science with a techno-creative dimension! As a graphic designer, you can create engaging infographics, flyers, illustration mailers, logos, and a lot of other graphic content to help businesses strengthen their identity in the virtual space,",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"With graphic designing capabilities, people may term you a computer science with a techno-creative dimension! As a graphic designer, you can create engaging infographics, flyers, illustration mailers, logos, and a lot of other graphic content to help businesses strengthen their identity in the virtual space,"}],["$","p","Graphic designers are in high-demand across every business, including real estate, technology, education, etc. But, what’s even more exciting is the fact you can begin freelancing as a graphic designer as soon as you finish training on it. So, you don’t have to depend on regular employment to earn money. You can leverage freelancing business opportunities and sail through the situation safely.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Graphic designers are in high-demand across every business, including real estate, technology, education, etc. But, what’s even more exciting is the fact you can begin freelancing as a graphic designer as soon as you finish training on it. So, you don’t have to depend on regular employment to earn money. You can leverage freelancing business opportunities and sail through the situation safely."}]]]}]
25:["$","section","Application Development",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Application Development"}],[["$","p","It seems desktops are gradually turning redundant. Although that may seem an overstatement, the use of smartphones, tablets, and laptops is certainly on the rise. This technological shift has given birth to a new career stream, and that’s application development.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"It seems desktops are gradually turning redundant. Although that may seem an overstatement, the use of smartphones, tablets, and laptops is certainly on the rise. This technological shift has given birth to a new career stream, and that’s application development."}],["$","p","Application developers develop intriguing and engaging mobile and web applications that facilitate quicker and easier access to information and foster quicker and precise actions.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Application developers develop intriguing and engaging mobile and web applications that facilitate quicker and easier access to information and foster quicker and precise actions."}],["$","p","Again, apart from regular employment, you may self-employ yourself to work as a freelancing application developer. Self-employment amidst a crisis, isn’t it exciting?",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Again, apart from regular employment, you may self-employ yourself to work as a freelancing application developer. Self-employment amidst a crisis, isn’t it exciting?"}]]]}]
26:["$","section","Robotics and Automation",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Robotics and Automation"}],[["$","p","If companies need automation and robotics in the days to come, you must learn them, and qualify to fulfill their needs. Automation accelerates routine processes across various business streams, such as manufacturing, technology, and many others. It expedites the pace of production and paves the way for better customer service.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"If companies need automation and robotics in the days to come, you must learn them, and qualify to fulfill their needs. Automation accelerates routine processes across various business streams, such as manufacturing, technology, and many others. It expedites the pace of production and paves the way for better customer service."}],["$","p","So, as someone qualified at robotics and automation, you pave the way to employment opportunities across diverse business streams, and not limiting yourself to the technology or the core IT space.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"So, as someone qualified at robotics and automation, you pave the way to employment opportunities across diverse business streams, and not limiting yourself to the technology or the core IT space."}]]]}]
27:["$","section","Cloud Computing",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Cloud Computing"}],[["$","p","Becoming a cloud professional is quite challenging, but cloud computing as a career option offers numerous growth opportunities. Your skills and knowledge of computer science can prove helpful in building a rewarding career in cloud computing.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Becoming a cloud professional is quite challenging, but cloud computing as a career option offers numerous growth opportunities. Your skills and knowledge of computer science can prove helpful in building a rewarding career in cloud computing."}],["$","p","According to a report, India will generate millions of jobs across the cloud computing space by 2022. So, cloud seems another prudent career choice, especially after COVID-19.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"According to a report, India will generate millions of jobs across the cloud computing space by 2022. So, cloud seems another prudent career choice, especially after COVID-19."}]]]}]
28:["$","section","Conclusion",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Conclusion"}],[["$","p","At present, the situation may seem panicky. But, the future is bright, promising, and moreover rewarding. So, there’s no reason for you to worry. The only thing is to get going at the right time, using time well, fine-tuning with the future, and the futuristic needs of businesses.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"At present, the situation may seem panicky. But, the future is bright, promising, and moreover rewarding. So, there’s no reason for you to worry. The only thing is to get going at the right time, using time well, fine-tuning with the future, and the futuristic needs of businesses."}],["$","p","Alongside developing technical expertise, begin working on your written and verbal communication skills as well. After all, survival isn’t the only objective, but excelling is one, isn’t it?",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Alongside developing technical expertise, begin working on your written and verbal communication skills as well. After all, survival isn’t the only objective, but excelling is one, isn’t it?"}]]]}]
29:["$","aside",null,{"className":"mt-12 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-accent bg-primary/5 p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-heading text-xl font-semibold","children":"The practical takeaway"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-muted-foreground","children":"Start with one meaningful learner outcome, create an authentic way to observe it, and support educators to improve the experience together."}]]}]
